description:
Rebuild `web/pages/home.md` to the Main artboard (https://claude.ai/artifact/EoXGtpzsayij4d7tmrfZ9r), top to bottom:
1. a stats row;
2. the steering invitation, signed in and signed out;
3. the lead story;
4. "The table this week";
5. "The map this week";
6. more stories;
7. Rising concepts;
8. the Proposals preview;
9. Underrated;
10. Latest signals;
11. The Weekly signup.

Stories, the Proposals preview and Underrated ship as placeholders until Reposition 3. Data-driven panels use the existing knowledge blocks.

Acceptance: the live home matches the artboard in light and dark at 1440 and 390, and every placeholder is tagged.
